 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the style of the named substrate at ",
 StyleBox["size", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"49084c1e-0265-4f97-b805-f08c0e1cebaf"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
