 " gives them as one list."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"a10f9a09-ae23-4bd4-833f-c74d24c2a339"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A substrate is a backdrop: the construction drawn on it carries the colour. \
The style draws the substrate in gray, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["StandardGray"]], "paclet:ref/StandardGray"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "168ffa38-98c3-49c6-a116-a9b042d750a8"],
 " edges and faintly filled vertex disks with a dark outline, lighter as the \
substrate grows."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"94825dae-d17f-457e-9286-0cc243711d91"],

